{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 560,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One October evening in 2016,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2880,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an Arkansas farmer was sitting in his \npickup truck just outside his field,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7120,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he was growing impatient."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9920,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Suddenly, another car pulled up \nbeside him, so the farmer got out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14480,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Seconds later,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17680,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he was murdered."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20160,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The farmer's name was Mike Wallace."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 22720,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He wasn't killed over money or land."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25360,
    "dDurationMs": 7440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was killed over a herbicide, a \nchemical designed to destroy weeds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32800,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This herbicide spread fear through rural \nAmerica, turning farmers against each other,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38720,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all because it belonged to a certain company."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43120,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This company's policies,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44160,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they pitted farmer against farmer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46240,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they could just send henchman to your door."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48880,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even if you just had the \nwrong seeds in your field,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51120,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they could send you to court and bankrupt you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54480,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In effect, they had a farmland monopoly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57520,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They owned more than 80% of the \nseeds planted in the United States."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62000,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And to get this monopoly, \nthey played the legal system-"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64880,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Colluding with corrupted EPA officials."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67520,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "twisted scientific evidence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68920,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now appears to have been caught red-handed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71200,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the chemicals they were making"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72960,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "destroyed the health of \ncommunities all over the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75760,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a video about Monsanto,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78080,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one of the biggest agricultural \ncompanies in the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82240,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Our investigation is based on \npublicly available documents,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85280,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "recordings and third-party opinions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87360,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All sources are linked in the description."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 91920,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 1942, a chemist named Franklin D. Jones"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94880,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "made an unusual enemy:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98720,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "poison ivy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100320,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, his children had a very \nviolent reaction to the plant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103520,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They would get intense rashes and swelling \nwhen they brushed up against the ivy,\n "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108240,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so Jones wanted a way to kill it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111360,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He experimented by spraying the ivy with hormones,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114720,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "chemicals that could regulate the plant's  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 116560,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "functions the same way they \ndo in humans and animals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119760,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "His hope was that one of these \nhormones would cause it to die."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123680,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Unfortunately, many had no effect and \nothers only made the ivy grow better."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128480,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then, one day, Jones noticed \nthat certain samples began to show  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 132640,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "autumn colors, much sooner than they should have."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 135360,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He watched as the vibrant \nhues turned to twisted shapes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138720,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then within days, these \nplants shriveled up and died."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143680,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Jones checked the chemical he \nsprayed them with, and surprisingly,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147200,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it was a growth hormone called 2,4-D."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150640,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's an acid made up of a ring of six carbons and  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153440,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hydrogens called a benzene \nring, with an acid tail."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157760,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are also two chlorine atoms in \nthe two and four positions of the ring,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161680,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is why it's called 2,4-D."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 164400,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To keep things tidy, we don't have to \ndraw all these carbons and hydrogens,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 167760,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but keep in mind they're still there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Jones realized this synthetic \nhormone was incredibly potent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174000,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Tiny amounts of it would still \nencourage the ivy to grow,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177200,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but if he sprayed on a lot \nof it, 2,4-D would trigger  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 180000,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "such uncontrollable and unsustainable growth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182560,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the poison ivy would die in the process."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185680,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So effectively, he had plant cancer in a bottle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189120,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was just going to say plant cancer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191280,
    "dDurationMs": 480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191760,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's immediately where my brain went."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 193520,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What was even more remarkable was \nthat it only targeted the ivy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197280,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The grass around it was barely affected, \nlike it was resistant to 2,4-D."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202480,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So over the next two years, Jones performed \nover a hundred different experiments"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207360,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by pouring the herbicide onto \nmany different plant species."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211280,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what he figured out was \nthat 2,4-D was really picky."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215200,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It killed broad-leaved weeds like \ndandelions, chickweed, and poison ivy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220000,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it virtually ignored crops."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 222400,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wheat, corn, and barley were all mostly  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225200,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "unaffected by 2,4-D because all \nof these are species of grass."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 230400,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To improve this pickiness further, Jones \nalso tested chemicals similar to 2,4-D."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235600,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He found that adding another \nchlorine to the benzene ring,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238240,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "transforming it to 2,4,5-T, left \ngrasses even more unscathed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243600,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was onto something huge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 246320,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because up until then, farmers could \nget rid of weeds one of two ways."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 249920,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Either you spray them with \ndangerous chemicals like arsenic"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253120,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or you have to pull the weeds out manually."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255600,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Either way, you're at a loss."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257040,
    "dDurationMs": 6480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But with 2,4-D and 2,4,5-T, you could spray your \nentire crop field, and only the weeds would die."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 263520,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Jones had stumbled upon the first \npractically viable selective herbicides,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267600,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so he was quick to patent them in \n1945, just as the war was ending."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 272000,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After the Allies victory, the patent secrecy \nrestrictions in most countries were lifted,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 276240,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it turned out that there were other \nscientists, both in the US but also in the UK,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280800,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who discovered these herbicides independently."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 283840,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Soon, the world was blessed with \nmodern miracle weed killers,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 286960,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like Weedone and Weed-A-Bomb and Endo-Weed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291200,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all formulations of 2,4-D and 2,4,5-T herbicides."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 295040,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This man is ready to kill weeds, because \nhe's going to do it the easy way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300160,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These chemicals literally replaced the hoe,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 302480,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and everything from farm fields \nto railroad tracks and sidewalks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 306640,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're essentially what gave us that beautiful \ngreen American lawn, just grass and nothing else."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311840,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because with these herbicides, dad knew there \nwas no longer any excuse for a weedy lawn."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316720,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By the late 1940s, their herbicide business \nhad turned into a roughly $10 million industry,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321840,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and everyone wanted in, including one of \nthe biggest chemical companies at the time:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327360,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Monsanto."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329280,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One of Monsanto's main herbicide \nfactories was in Nitro, West Virginia,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333280,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where they pumped out almost \na ton of 2,4,5-T a day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336960,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By 1949, Monsanto's business was \nbooming, when all of a sudden..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 343040,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the plant exploded."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 345360,
    "dDurationMs": 6400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Over a hundred workers rushed out to see a \ndark cloud rising 40 meters above the factory."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351760,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They watched as a black stinking powder \nstarted raining down on their faces."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357840,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Within hours, many of these men fell ill."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 361040,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, they got headaches and nausea,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 363280,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but then their skin began to erupt \nwith bumps, pustules, and acne."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 368160,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The lesions on some of the workers' \nfaces got so bad that Monsanto's  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 371920,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on-site doctors had to peel off layers of \ntheir skin in an attempt to remove them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 377520,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The doctors later noted that when these men are \nin a closed room together, there is a strong odor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 383440,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They wrote, \"We believe these men are excreting \na foreign chemical through their skins.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 389120,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But neither the doctors nor anyone else \nat Monsanto knew what the chemical was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 393600,
    "dDurationMs": 6240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because both 2,4,5-T and 2,4-D \nwere marketed as very safe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 399840,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, when the herbicides were first getting \nintroduced, Jones, the original inventor,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404160,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even remarked that he knew people \nwho would accidentally drink or  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408640,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "spray the herbicides onto themselves, \nand they suffered no ill health effects."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412640,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They were fine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 413600,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And one of the doctors after him remarked that:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417120,
    "dDurationMs": 6800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"I've personally taken one half a gram \nof pure 2,4-D a day for three weeks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423920,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You judge the results.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425120,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was the '40s, so people were a bit crazy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427520,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But yeah, it seemed pretty safe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 430400,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Back at Nitro, Monsanto analyzed all the other \ningredients they were using to make 2,4,5-T,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 435760,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but they still couldn't find what was causing \ntheir workers' skin to erupt in this way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441520,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is where their search seemingly stopped."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 444240,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With no culprit, the conditions at \nthe plant stayed mostly the same,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 448160,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Monsanto just offered their workers a choice:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 450960,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "either you'll keep on working with 2,4,5-T"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 453920,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or you can take the gate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 456160,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For many, this was no choice at all since \nthere were hardly any other jobs in town."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 461040,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, most of the workers stayed \nwith something inside the factory,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 464400,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "poisoning them for years to come."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467280,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It wasn't until 1957, 8 years after the explosion,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471360,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that a German dermatologist, Karl Schulz,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474320,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "found himself treating patients with \nsimilar-looking lesions and acne."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 478800,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He wasn't surprised by the symptoms because  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 480800,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "many of these patients worked in \n2,4,5-T factories around Hamburg."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 485440,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when Schulz would test these \ningredients from the instruction  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 488080,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "list on rabbit ears he had at the \nlab, he would get no reactions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 492880,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this puzzled him."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 494240,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How do these ingredients do \nnothing in his own tests,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497280,
    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but at the same time cause these painful \nskin disorders inside 2,4,5-T factories?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 503440,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, to make 2,4,5-T, you \nstart with tetrachlorobenzene,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 506880,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a benzene ring with four \nchlorine atoms attached to it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510080,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These chlorine atoms are very electronegative, so \nthey want to steal electrons from nearby atoms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 515520,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Luckily for them, the six \ncarbons in the benzene ring  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 518240,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are all sharing their electrons in these \nfuzzy donut-shaped clouds around the ring."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 522640,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's what this circle in the \ndiagram is meant to represent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 525680,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The chlorine atoms pull on this electron cloud, \nbringing it closer to themselves, and as a result,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 530880,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the carbons in the benzene ring \nbecome slightly positively charged  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 534240,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the chlorine's slightly negatively charged."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 536960,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, if you heat up tetrachlorobenzene \nwith sodium hydroxide,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540560,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one of the negative hydroxide ions will want to  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 543200,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bind to one of the slightly positively \ncharged carbons in the benzene ring."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 547120,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And to do that, it forces out the \nchlorine atom, taking its place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 552000,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This creates trichlorophenol, or TCP, a \nkey ingredient in making the herbicide."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 557680,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From here, if you keep the \nreaction at 170 degrees Celsius,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 561520,
    "dDurationMs": 6880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can add a series of chemicals to grow out \nthis oxygen tail into an acid, giving you 2,4,5-T."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 568400,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On paper, this is all there is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 570400,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you follow the exact steps here and control \nthe conditions, then none of these ingredients  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 575040,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will explain the horrible face eruptions \nthat the Nitro workers were experiencing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 579280,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Schulz wasn't satisfied with this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 581680,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Maybe the conditions aren't perfect."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 583840,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Maybe there is something in this \nprocess, some secret reaction  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 587200,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is contaminating the whole chemical supply."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 590960,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ideally, the industrial process \nof transforming tetrachlorobenzene  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 594400,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into 2,4,5-T should happen at 170 degrees Celsius."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 598560,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if the temperature gets any \nhigher, even just a few degrees higher,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 602800,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there is suddenly enough energy in the system \nfor two molecules of TCP to fuse together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 608480,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This creates a molecule commonly known as dioxin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 612960,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It forms only in trace amounts, so you \nmight expect to end up with roughly one  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 617200,
    "dDurationMs": 6560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or two molecules of dioxin for every \nhundred thousand molecules of 2,4,5-T."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 623760,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seemed too small to be a problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 626320,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nevertheless, Schulz decided to test it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 628560,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He took some TCP, this time contaminated with  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 631440,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "trace amounts of dioxin, and \nrubbed it into his own skin,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 636320,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he got the same acne as \nthe workers at the Nitro plant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 640960,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Once Schulz realized the threat here,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 642880,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he immediately contacted all the \nbig chemical producers in Germany,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 646400,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and one of these German companies even \nsent letters to both Monsanto and Dow,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 650560,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the other big herbicide producer in the US,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 653120,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they warned them that the acne-causing effects  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 655680,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are stemming from pollution through \nbyproducts, referring to dioxin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 659920,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They even listed when exactly during the process  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 662320,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the contamination was happening \nand what to do to prevent it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 666400,
    "dDurationMs": 6480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yet, Monsanto denied ever getting these letters, \nand Dow said they somehow misfiled them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 672880,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Regardless, it was obvious to \nboth companies that something  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 675840,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the production of 2,4,5-T \nwas poisoning their workers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 679520,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Monsanto didn't warn \nthe public about the danger,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 682640,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "perhaps because the herbicides were \nabout to make them a whole lot of money."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 687440,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 1961, the president of South Vietnam was \nat war with the newly founded Viet Cong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 693360,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This guerrilla force was set on overthrowing his \nrule and uniting Vietnam under a communist regime."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 699120,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Viet Cong were masters of the jungle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 701600,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They laid deadly traps for their enemies \nand ambushed them using underground tunnels."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 706240,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "South Vietnam was losing the war, \nso the president faced a choice:  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 710960,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "either accept defeat in the jungle or destroy it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 716000,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He reached out to his allies, \nthe US, and asked them for help."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 722000,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Soon, they came in flying with \nthousands of barrels of herbicide."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 726640,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This was the start of Operation Ranch Hand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 731280,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The US's herbicide of choice was Agent Orange,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 734480,
    "dDurationMs": 7440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a 50/50 split of 2,4-D and 2,4,5-T supplied \nby the US's biggest chemical manufacturers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 741920,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The largest supplier by volume was Monsanto."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 745760,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Agent Orange ravaged through South \nVietnam destroying 20% of the jungles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 750800,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And civilians and soldiers on both sides \ngot sprayed with it too, mostly by accident."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 756400,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The government assured them \nthat it is not toxic to humans,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 759520,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "animals, or drinking water, but \nMonsanto and Dow knew otherwise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 765120,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See during Ranch Hand, they secretly \nexchanged information on their herbicides."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 769440,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in one of the letters, \nDow acknowledged that dioxin,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 772560,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which had been contaminating 2,4,5-T for years"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 775280,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was \"the most toxic compound \nthey have ever experienced\","
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 778560,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that even trace amounts of \nit caused incapacitating acne."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 782880,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By 1965, it was obvious that both companies \nunderstood what sort of threat dioxin was,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 788960,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and yet there are no records \nthat Monsanto or Dow ever sent  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 792960,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "communication to the US government \nwarning them about the threat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 796960,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, Dow's vice president reportedly said,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 799520,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"If the government learns about this, \nthe whole industry will suffer.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 804240,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As a result, the US sprayed South Vietnam \nwith 72 million liters of Agent Orange,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 810240,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "within which was just 80 liters of dioxin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 814080,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And even though that doesn't seem \nlike much, the damage was irreparable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 818640,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Civilians and soldiers on both sides \nsuffered from skin diseases and cancer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 823600,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Children were born with physical \nand mental disabilities."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 826800,
    "dDurationMs": 6400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By some estimates, as many as three million \npeople suffered from the effects of Agent Orange."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 833200,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This outraged the public."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 835280,
    "dDurationMs": 6800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 1967, 5,000 scientists signed a petition to the \npresident condemning his use of the herbicides."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 842080,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And Monsanto was under scrutiny too,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 844640,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because regulators were catching on \nto the dioxin contained in 2,4,5-T."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 849280,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The herbicide was about to be phased \nout, compromising their bottom line."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 853760,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Monsanto needed a miracle, \nand they needed it fast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 858880,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Their idea was to replace \n2,4,5-T with a safer herbicide."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 862880,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But after nine years of research, \nthey weren't getting anywhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 866560,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All of the scientists in \nthe Agricultural department  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 869040,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "referred to this new initiative as a dead area."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 873520,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One of the last remaining scientists \non the project was John E. Franz,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 877120,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and by early 1970, he was about to give it up too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 880720,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But before abandoning the project, Franz \ndecided to do one final set of experiments,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 885760,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so he thought up 19 possible \nassets that could maybe work  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 888960,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as herbicides and decided to test them out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 891840,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He prepped the first herbicide, \nbut nothing happened."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 897760,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The plant was completely fine, \nand the herbicide had no activity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 900800,
    "dDurationMs": 12320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then he decided to test the second \nherbicide, and he applied it to a plant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 913120,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was 10 times more powerful than \nany herbicide the team had ever seen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 917600,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And allegedly, it made the plants super..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 921840,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It made the plants super nasty."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 923680,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That was disgusting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 925760,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This miracle compound was glyphosate,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 928560,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a phosphonic acid group on one end and a \ncarboxyl group on the other with a nitrogen,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 933680,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hydrogen, or amino group in between."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 936000,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To make sure it was commercially feasible,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 938000,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Franz and his colleague set up \ntests in these outdoor fields."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 941040,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as one of the scientists was \ngetting back to these test sites,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 944160,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he saw the results from the plane."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 946640,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was clear as day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 949200,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All he could do is write Eureka \nacross the performance report."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 952560,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was the best herbicide they'd ever seen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 955760,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What made it so great at killing plants?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 958480,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, for plants to survive, \nthey use a chemical pathway,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 961600,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a series of reactions to create three important \namino acids, acids without which they die."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 967680,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This process is known as the \nShikimate pathway because it  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 971200,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "starts with shikimic acid named \nafter the Japanese Shikimi flower."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 975840,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "During one of the steps, two acids, S3P and \nPEP need to transform into a third compound,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 981840,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but they can only do that with the \nhelp of an enzyme called EPSPS,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 985840,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which catalyzes the reaction and \nhelps the two molecules combine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 989600,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, if glyphosate is \npresent during this reaction,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 992640,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it will begin to mimic PEP because \nthey have a very similar geometry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 996880,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And because of that, glyphosate actually binds  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 999440,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "first to EPSPS blocking it \nfrom acting as a catalyst."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1003760,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, the acids can't transform and the \nwhole Shikimate pathway is destroyed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1008720,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Without it, there are no amino \nacids and the plant dies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1013760,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Crucially, the Shikimate pathway is unique \nto plants and things like bacteria and fungi."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1018880,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Humans and animals don't have it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1021200,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, we have to eat foods that \ncontain these three amino acids."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1025200,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But for Monsanto, this was good \nnews because they could market  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1027840,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that glyphosate targets an enzyme found \nin plants, but not in humans or pets."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1033840,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After decades of toxic products, Monsanto \nfinally had one which they were sure was safe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1039600,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And research was also showing \nthat after you spray glyphosate,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1042480,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the microorganisms in the soil \nbreak it down into safe byproducts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1046080,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was biodegradable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1047600,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Glyphosate was perfect, so they wasted \nno time in getting it on the market."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1051760,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 1974, Monsanto had a new hit herbicide..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1056560,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Roundup."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1057360,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Roundup is better."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1058880,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It goes through the plant to \nkill it, tops and rhizomes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1063360,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My roots hurt real bad."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1065280,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hank, Hank!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1066560,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Roundup. No root, no weed, no problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1069200,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Farmers loved it because unlike \n2,4-D, glyphosate killed every weed,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1073840,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not just broad-leaved ones, but grassy too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1076240,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It allowed them to practice \nsomething called no-till farming."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1079120,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, usually to get rid of weeds, you'd have to \nplow up the entire field before planting anything,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1084000,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that would hurt the soil, \nand it was also just a lot work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1086960,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But with Roundup, what you do is you \nspray the whole field, everything dies,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1090960,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then you just plant directly into the residue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1093200,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was easier, faster, and cheaper."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1096160,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And Roundup was safe to use too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1098000,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They marketed it as safer than table \nsalt and safe enough to drink, basically."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1102640,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Roundup can be used where kids and pets will \nplay and breaks down into natural materials."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1108720,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By the late eighties, Monsanto \nwas selling seven million pounds  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1112160,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of Roundup and making a billion dollars each year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1115680,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they weren't going to share a \npenny of that money with anyone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1120320,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, with other herbicides, \nlike for example, Alachlor,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1123280,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which was moderately popular at the time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1125440,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can tweak the molecule a bit here or there, \nand you still get a very potent weed killer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1130800,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so if you patented a specific herbicide,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1132960,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your competitors could still use \nhundreds of its close relatives,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1136320,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which would still work perfectly well \nwithout violating your patent rights."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1140800,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But glyphosate was different,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1142560,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if you were to modify the molecule in any way, \nits herbicidal properties were completely gone,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1148000,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so Monsanto could rest easy \nknowing that until the year 2000,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1152080,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they would be the only ones able to sell it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1157040,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there was a little problem with glyphosate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1159280,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, unlike 2,4-D, which only killed \nbroadleaved weeds, Roundup kills everything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1164400,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I sprayed some of my own houseplants \nhere and well, you can see the results."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1168560,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Chances are if it's green, \nRoundup is going to kill it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1172080,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this was a problem because farmers could \nonly really spray Roundup on their field twice,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1176640,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "either right before planting the \nseeds or right after a harvest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1181200,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But for Monsanto, this \nwasn't as much of a problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1183360,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, they thought if we could somehow make the \ncrops like soybean or corn resistant to Roundup,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1189120,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well then farmers could spray it on \ntheir field during the whole year,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1192640,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it would keep killing the weeds,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1194560,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but not the Roundup resistant crops."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1197120,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Crops which Monsanto could sell them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1199600,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as a result, they would \nhave a complete monopoly  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1202000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over both the herbicide and the seed supply."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1206000,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Monsanto's idea was this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1207920,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if glyphosate blocks the EPSPS enzyme in plants  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1211840,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then they could edit the plant's DNA so \nthat the cells just create more EPSPS."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1216960,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If there's enough of the enzyme then \nglyphosate can't block all of it,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1220560,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so the plant can still survive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1222800,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They tried this out on \npetunias, but it didn't work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1226080,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The flowers would survive a tiny amount of \nRoundup, but a normal dose would still kill them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1231280,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Monsanto was kind of stumped, and \nthey didn't have time to rest,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1234400,
    "dDurationMs": 6640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because while glyphosate and Roundup were under \ntheir patents, a Roundup resistant seed wasn't."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1241040,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And their competitors knew this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1243360,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 1985, a company called Calgene published  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1246320,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a paper in nature showing that they made \ntobacco slightly resistant to glyphosate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1251600,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The paper showed promise, but more importantly,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1253840,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it made it clear to Monsanto that \nthey were running out of time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1257520,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Their researchers were desperate calling \nthis patent race the \"Manhattan Project\"."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1261920,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then one of the engineers had a genius idea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1264400,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Monsanto had a ton of these factories where \nthey were converting phosphate into glyphosate,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1269680,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they had a lot of sludge \nleaching out of these factories,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1272720,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so if there was anything living \naround these factories in this sludge,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1276880,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there was a chance it was resistant to glyphosate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1279840,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The researchers went to one of these factories,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1282080,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "scooped it out, and found a \nstrain of salmonella in there,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1285600,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which was surprising to them because salmonella \nusually relies on the Shikimate pathway,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1290000,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but here it was thriving in glyphosate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1293600,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Monsanto's scientists isolated \nthe salmonella's genetic sequence,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1296800,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and found that it had evolved a way to \nmutate the shape of its EPSPS enzyme  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1301600,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that glyphosate couldn't bind to \nit and block the Shikimate pathway."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1305840,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The scientists took that salmonella \nDNA and loaded it onto a gene gun,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1310960,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not this one here, but it's \nactually surprisingly similar."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1314240,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, they placed thousands of these salmonella DNA  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1316880,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "strips onto microscopic gold \nparticles in the gene gun,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1320160,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which they then fired into the plant tissue \nall over, at 1,400 kilometers per hour."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1325680,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The gold particles would bombard the plant cells, \nand some of them would make it into the nucleus."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1330400,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here, the DNA detaches from the gold, and it \nintegrates itself into the plant's chromosomes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1336000,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, every time this cell divides, \nit copies over the new EPSPS gene."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1340320,
    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Monsanto scientists planted seeds with these genes \nout in the field and sprayed them with Roundup,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1346480,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but nothing happened. The soybean was resistant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1350320,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Monsanto made sure to act quickly soon \nafter they found even more potent bacteria,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1354800,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they were able to make \nother crop species immune too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1357840,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And by 1998, they had patents for glyphosate \nresistant canola, corn, and cotton."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1363120,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They called this lineup of \nGMO seeds Roundup Ready."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1366640,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These Roundup Ready seeds took \nover the market in an instant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1370480,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Already by 2001, more than 70% \nof all soybeans grown in the US  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1375360,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were Monsanto's with Roundup making \nthem more than $2.5 billion a year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1380880,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was the best-selling agricultural product ever."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1383760,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And every farmer could join in on this \nRoundup plus Roundup Ready revolution  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1388400,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just by signing Monsanto's \nTechnology Use Agreement."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1392880,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've got one of these agreements from 2011 \nhere, and I just wanted to read some terms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1398080,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The grower or the farmer who accepts and wants to  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1400880,
    "dDurationMs": 8480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "use these seeds agrees to not save or clean \nany crop produced from the seed for planting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1409360,
    "dDurationMs": 6800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the farmer also agrees not to supply the seed \nproduced from the seed to anyone for planting,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1416160,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "meaning you cannot save the seeds you \nbought last year to plant this year,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1420720,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you also cannot share or \nsell your seeds to anyone else."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1424960,
    "dDurationMs": 6560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here's another one, the farmer agrees \nto identify and allow Monsanto and its  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1431520,
    "dDurationMs": 6160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "representatives access to the land \nfarmed by the grower or the farmer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1437680,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this allows Monsanto to examine \nand take samples of the crops,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1442720,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "crop residue or the seeds located therein."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1446320,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And here's a final one, the grower \naccepts the terms of the following  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1450000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "notice requirements by signing this agreement,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1454000,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or by opening a bag of seeds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1456640,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you're agreeing to these terms \neven just by opening a bag of seeds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1461280,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you thought that this contract was crazy,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1462960,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you should see the stuff that \nwe sign up to today online."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1466640,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have some terms and conditions \nhere from a social media website."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1469840,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here's what it says."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1471200,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"We may collect biometric identifiers,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1473440,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we may infer your attributes, \nsuch as age range and gender.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1477360,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So they're able to scan your face \nand sell that data to advertisers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1481440,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And just in the last couple of \nmonths, companies have been making  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1483840,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these aggressive pushes to their terms and \nconditions to try and get more of your data,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1488080,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they can use it to train AI models \nor just sell it to data brokers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1491600,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this doesn't just mean annoying \nads and spam emails and phone calls."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1495600,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Law enforcement can buy your data, \nand normal people can buy it too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1499280,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even stuff like your location history."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1501200,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And all of that is perfectly legal,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1503920,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but luckily you can take steps to prevent it \nwith the help of today's sponsor, Incogni."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1508640,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, I started using Incogni in June."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1511280,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Look, you can see that they already contacted \n46 data brokers to delete my personal data,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1516720,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and 42 of those requests have been completed, \nand I've actually been getting fewer spam emails."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1521840,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The new thing is that they now offer \nan unlimited plan with custom removals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1525920,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you are browsing online \nand see a website with your data,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1529600,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even though it shouldn't have the data,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1531280,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can ask one of Incogni's experts \nto manually take it down for you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1535120,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you want to extend that \nsort of protection to someone else,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1538560,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they also have a family plan \nthat supports up to five members."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1542480,
    "dDurationMs": 5840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To try it, go to incogni.com/veritasium, \nand use the code Veritasium to get 60% off."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1548320,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can also use this QR code."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1550000,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's incogni.com/veritasium, or you can \nalso click the link in the description."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1554880,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I want to thank Incogni for \nsponsoring this part of the video,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1557840,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and now back to farmers and the terms \nand conditions they had to sign."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1562560,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, couldn't farmers just decide not \nto use Monsanto's seeds and herbicide?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1567760,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The thing was, you have Roundup Ready \nseeds and you spray them with Roundup,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1572000,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "everything's going to be fine on your end."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1573760,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But your neighbor doesn't \nhave Roundup Ready seeds,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1576240,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so if your herbicide drifts over to your \nneighbor's side, it's going to kill his plants."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1580480,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So neighbors were concerned thinking \ntheir crops were going to be lost,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1583680,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so they got Roundup Ready as well, and soon \nenough, Monsanto controlled the whole market."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1588400,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the control didn't end there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1590160,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As one seed grower from Ohio remembers it,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1592640,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Monsanto's salesman would tell \npeople they could either sign on,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1595840,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or they'd all be out of business \nwithin the next two years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1598960,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Monsanto was going to dominate \nthe entire seed industry,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1601760,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there was nothing anybody could do about it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1604880,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So hundreds of thousands of farmers \nsigned the deal, and it wasn't a good one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1609920,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One evening in late July of 2004,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1612160,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an Indiana farmer named Dave Runyon was relaxing \nat home when two men knocked on his door."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1617760,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They led me to believe that they \nwere doing a survey for a magazine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1622400,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They wanted to know what kind of crops I planted."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1625120,
    "dDurationMs": 6080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They wanted to know what kind of herbicides I \nused, the seed I bought and purchased and used."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1631200,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Runyon wasn't interested, so \nhe decided to shut the door,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1634160,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when he heard one of the men \nsay, \"I think he's guilty.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1637680,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Runyon didn't know what they \nmeant, but a few months later,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1640480,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he got a letter from Monsanto saying that he had  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1642880,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "seven days to turn over all of his \nbusiness records to the company."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1646240,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He was shocked, because Runyon was one of the few  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1648560,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "farmers that never signed \na contract with Monsanto,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1651760,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and yet here they were threatening \nto sue him for patent infringement."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1655600,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Apparently, someone had tipped Monsanto off that \nRunyon had been replanting their seeds illegally,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1661120,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and farmers all across the country \nwere getting the same types of letters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1665520,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Honestly, it's kind of hard to overstate \nhow much Monsanto tried to control farmers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1670560,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They sent private detectives and ex-cops \nto inspect farms all over the US,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1675120,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "waving their terms and conditions of the contract  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1677680,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into farmers' faces to let \nthem onto their property."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1680720,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They hired plane and helicopter pilots to survey  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1683440,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the farmlands from above \nfor signs of infringement."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1686720,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The lawsuits, the threats."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1688400,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How could people possibly stand up to them?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1690480,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they even had a company hotline,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1692960,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "1-800-ROUNDUP, that farmers could \ncall to snitch on their neighbors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1697680,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It still exists."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1698880,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "1-800-ROUNDUP."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1701200,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're calling them now?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1702480,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think I got it right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1705200,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you have information about the misuse of \nseed or a compliance issue, please press three."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1710880,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That phone number was in existence in the \nsame time that we're talking about there,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1714800,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where people could rat out their neighbor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1717840,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As Runyon himself puts it, \"There is \nmuch mistrust in the countryside today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1722000,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You never know who might report on you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1724400,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You could actually willfully plant unauthorized  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1726800,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "seed in somebody's land if \nyou want to destroy them.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1730560,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, in 2010, Monsanto responded \nto farmers' concerns about these  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1734160,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "investigations and released a commitment \nstatement regarding their patents."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1738480,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They mentioned their pledge to \ntransparency and ethical behavior,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1742480,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "properly introducing themselves \nwith displayed identification,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1745920,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and not exercising their patent rights when only  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1748320,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "trace amounts of their seed is \npresent in a farmer's field."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1752880,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While Monsanto ultimately ended \nup letting Runyon go, by 2013,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1756960,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they sued over 400 farmers, \nraking in over $20 million."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1761600,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Many of these farmers went bankrupt,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1763200,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and countless others settled with Monsanto \nout of court even if they were innocent,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1768080,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because they just couldn't risk the legal fees."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1771120,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, they were actually \ninfluencing radio stations at one point,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1774000,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the radio stations would \npublicly say the name of the  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1777040,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people who were saving Roundup seeds on air."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1780240,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That sounds like a supervillain plot, really."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1784000,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, well people actually started \ncalling them Mon-satan, so..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1788480,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This culture of fear and paranoia \nturned neighbors against each other,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1792320,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "especially in communities where some farmers \ndidn't wish to use Monsanto's herbicide system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1797280,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One of those farmers was Mike Wallace."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1800240,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, Mike had a field of soybean here that \nwasn't resistant to Monsanto's herbicide,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1806000,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but his neighbor who was also growing \nsoybean did use Monsanto's system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1809760,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, to be clear, this herbicide \nwasn't glyphosate itself, it was  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1813520,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Monsanto's other herbicide product called Dicamba,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1816240,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it was still packaged in this \nRoundup and Roundup Ready system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1819360,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, one day Mike noticed that some of \nhis soybean was dying, and he suspected  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1823760,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it was the herbicide from the neighboring \nfarm drifting over, killing his soybean,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1828320,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he could tell this was the \ncase because the weeds underneath  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1831040,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the neighbor's soybean were dying, \nallegedly because of the herbicide."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1835440,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And he believed this caused him around \na hundred thousand dollars in damages,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1839280,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the neighbor denied that it was his fault."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1842240,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, the tensions between the two farms grew,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1844000,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so Mike wanted to chat with one of the workers \nfrom the farm to discuss the situation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1848560,
    "dDurationMs": 5440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They met on a country field road near both \nfarms, and what happened next isn't really clear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1854000,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Things got sour quickly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1855760,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allegedly, Mike grabbed the worker's arm, so \nthe worker pulled back and pulled out his gun,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1860800,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"shooting Wallace until the gun was empty\"."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1865520,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Similar kinds of tragedies were \nhappening all over the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1869200,
    "dDurationMs": 6560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Monsanto infiltrated farming communities in India, \nArgentina, Canada, Brazil, and even Vietnam."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1875760,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By the 2010s, they were an \nalmost untouchable monopoly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1880160,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then out of the blue on March 20th \n2015, an independent science panel  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1885440,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "called the International Agency \nfor Research on Cancer, or IARC,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1890000,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "came out with this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1891520,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a paper saying, \"Glyphosate is \nprobably carcinogenic to humans.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1897200,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The most popular weed killer \nin the world may cause cancer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1901440,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "IARC's classification of glyphosate \nas a probable carcinogen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1905520,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "damage to chromosomes and DNA in human cells."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1908720,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This came as a shock to \neveryone, especially Monsanto."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1912240,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They don't know how IARC could \nreach a conclusion such as this one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1916240,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, other big health organizations, like the \nUS Environmental Protection Agency, the EPA,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1921520,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and even the World Health Organization, which \nis actually the parent organization to IARC,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1926880,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "both claimed that glyphosate posed no \ncarcinogenic risk to humans and animals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1932960,
    "dDurationMs": 5840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think the IARC designation took \nthe public by such huge surprise,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1938800,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because Monsanto had really done \nsuch a good job for 40-plus years  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1943920,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "convincing the world that this \nstuff was safer than table salt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1949520,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Monsanto was furious about this \nruling, so on the same day,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1952880,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they sent a scathing letter to \nthe World Health Organization"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1956160,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "complaining how this classification \nneeds to be rectified immediately."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1959920,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They claimed IARC chose to \ndisregard dozens of studies,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1962880,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that conclusions on \nglyphosate must be non-biased,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1966320,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thorough, and based on quality science."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1969520,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Soon after, five review papers came out bashing  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1972400,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the IARC classification and \ncriticizing their decision."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1976080,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So why would IARC disagree \nwith all the other agencies,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1979440,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and why would they ignore so many studies?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1983840,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, this is exactly the question California \nlawyer Brent Wisner wanted to answer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1988320,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wisner had been looking into \nMonsanto for a while now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1991040,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Allegedly, Roundup was causing \na decline in the bee population,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1994640,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so he thought he could make a case out of it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1996880,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But one day, one of Wisner's colleagues \ntold him that her cousin-in-law had been  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2000640,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "using Roundup on his farm for \nas long as she could remember,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2003920,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then both he and his dog developed \nnon-Hodgkin's lymphoma, or NHL,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2008240,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a type of cancer targeting the lymphatic system,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2011040,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he died in late 2015."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2013040,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He didn't stop using it until \nhe was too weak to do anything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2017280,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He didn't think there was any danger with Roundup."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2020800,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, the IARC paper that came out saying \nglyphosate is a probable carcinogen  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2025200,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "actually pointed out that the strongest \nevidence was for non-Hodgkin's lymphoma."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2029280,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And reports of Roundup users getting diagnosed \nwith NHL were popping up more frequently."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2033920,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This seemed like more than just a coincidence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2036640,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wisner thought he had a case, but Monsanto was \na corporate giant he couldn't tackle alone,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2041680,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so he teamed up with other lawyers,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2043280,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and also an investigative journalist who'd \nbeen reporting on Monsanto for decades."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2048640,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there's a lot to write about."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2050280,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I spent a lot of time at Monsanto headquarters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2053440,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It became pretty clear, \"This company \nreally doesn't care about its customers.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2058240,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2059920,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Together, this group of lawyers \nstarted a lawsuit against Monsanto,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2063680,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they forced them to hand \nover their company documents."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2066880,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Monsanto had to comply, and \nso the lawyers got access to  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2070320,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "their internal emails, memos, and safety studies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2073680,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Saying one thing publicly and saying \nsomething completely different internally."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2077680,
    "dDurationMs": 7200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The duplicity, the deception, \nis just jaw-dropping, really."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2084880,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 1983, Monsanto submitted a glyphosate  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2087840,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "toxicology study to the EPA \nto get it classified as safe,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2091600,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the data was showing that mice receiving  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2093760,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "higher doses of glyphosate were \ndeveloping rare kidney tumors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2097440,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The EPA was obviously worried with this,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2099360,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they wanted to classify glyphosate \nas a possible human carcinogen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2104720,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So they asked Monsanto to do more studies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2107840,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And Monsanto fought back against that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2110000,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"No, you just need to trust \nwhat we're telling you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2112720,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're reading the data \nwrong,\" et cetera et cetera."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2116800,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Monsanto wouldn't comply, and they \npushed back against the EPA until 1989,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2122400,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when the EPA suddenly changed its mind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2124880,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They said, \"A repeat of the mouse oncogenicity \nwill not be required at this time.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2130240,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And instead, in 1991, the EPA classified  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2133360,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "glyphosate as having evidence of \nnon-carcinogenicity for humans."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2138240,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The cancer concern in mice was never made public,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2140880,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this new classification \ncertainly helped push Roundup sales,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2144480,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at least until more independent research came in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2147840,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, one of the most influential research papers \non Roundup actually came out in the year 2000."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2152560,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was the Safety Evaluation and Risk \nAssessment of the Herbicide Roundup  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2156320,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and its Active Ingredient Glyphosate for Humans,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2159120,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "commonly just called Williams, \nKroes, and Munro after its authors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2163040,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This was the landmark paper on glyphosate safety,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2165920,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which concluded that Roundup herbicide \ndoes not pose a health risk to humans."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2171280,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This paper was cited over \n1200 times, which is a lot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2175520,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it was considered then by regulators \nof the foundational research paper to say  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2180480,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that glyphosate was safe, this independent paper."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2183680,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Except the paper wasn't independent at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2186480,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, Monsanto's director of the \ntoxicology group, William Heydens,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2190000,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was listed on the paper as someone \nwho provided scientific support."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2193680,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So in a 2017 deposition, Wisner and his fellow \nlawyers decided to ask Heydens about it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2198720,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Were your contributions in your view \nto the Williams paper substantial?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2203280,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, they were not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2204080,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As I said, they were editorial, \njust to make it easier to read."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2208000,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But here's how Heydens referred to his \ninvolvement in the paper internally."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2212160,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"I have sprouted several new gray hairs \nduring the writing of this thing,\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2215760,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or \"I'll strangle Kroes or Williams \nif they ask for any rewrites!!\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2219520,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And much later, \"We would be keeping \nthe cost down by us doing the writing  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2223200,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they would just edit and \nsign their names, so to speak."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2226400,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Recall that is how we handled \nWilliams Kroes and Munro.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2230240,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they celebrated when it was finally done."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2232640,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You see in their internal documents,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2234240,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they talk about how this is going to be \nour defense, glyphosate around the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2239840,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The patterns of Monsanto's manipulation \nwere just popping up everywhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2244080,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They tried to change glyphosate cancer \nclassifications at different agencies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2248240,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They seemingly colluded with corrupt EPA \nofficials to try and kill opposing research."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2253280,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they ghost-wrote safety studies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2255760,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By mid 2017, Wisner released all of \nthese internal documents to the public,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2259920,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "now known as the Monsanto Papers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2262320,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "People were furious."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2264000,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Newly released docs show Monsanto executives \ncolluding with corrupted EPA officials."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2269520,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Would try to influence media and science reports."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2272880,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Monsanto appears to have been caught red-handed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2275440,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We have a paper trail that goes back to the 1980s."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2278560,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Stakes for Monsanto are extremely high."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2281440,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Soon, lawyers were overwhelmed \nwith calls from cancer patients  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2284480,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who used Roundup and got diagnosed with NHL."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2287440,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They wished to be included in the lawsuit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2289760,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By the end of the year, more than \n3000 victims had signed onto the case."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2293920,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Monsanto tried to do everything \nto dismantle these carcinogen claims."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2298240,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You remember the five independent papers that  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2300160,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "came out bashing the IARC decision to \ncall glyphosate a probable carcinogen?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2304400,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, the main review article \nthere was ghostwritten by Monsanto."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2307840,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you could see this paper getting edited \nand changed by people who worked for Monsanto."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2313200,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it has been frustrating \nto see journals basically  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2316320,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at every step of the way declining to retract."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2321280,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That paper is still online today, \nand Monsanto went all the way to  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2325280,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "discredit anyone who is opposing their view"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2327600,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with something called their \n'Let Nothing Go' Strategy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2331040,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let Nothing Go is essentially \nlike, let nothing go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2334080,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Somebody tweets online, Roundup \ncauses cancer, you don't let that go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2339040,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You have an onslaught of \npeople responding to that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2342960,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They had whole training operations where \nthey would bring in nutritionists and  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2348240,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "academics and other people to train \nthem what to say and how to say it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2352800,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I do not believe that glyphosate in \nArgentina is causing increases in cancer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2357920,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can drink a whole quart \nof it and it won't hurt you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2361360,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You want to drink some?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2362240,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We have some here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2363120,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'd be happy to actually."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2364400,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But not really."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2366160,
    "dDurationMs": 480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2366640,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I know it wouldn't hurt me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2367520,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, if you say so, I have some glyphosate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2369800,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, no, I'm not stupid."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2371920,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But they very much became \nan army that Monsanto could  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2375760,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "deploy when a news article came out, for instance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2379920,
    "dDurationMs": 6320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Are we going to get some comments under this \nvideo that are actually written by Monsanto?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2386240,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I wouldn't be surprised."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2388320,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But all of the confusion Monsanto tried \nto create around glyphosate wasn't enough."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2392800,
    "dDurationMs": 6400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By the summer of 2018, the truth was out and over \n11,000 plaintiffs filed lawsuits against Monsanto."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2399200,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This was going to destroy them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2401040,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But unfortunately, Monsanto had an escape plan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2404480,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just as the first lawsuit \nagainst them was starting,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2406880,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they signed an acquisition deal \nwith German chemical giant, Bayer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2410960,
    "dDurationMs": 6880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Monsanto cashed in, the executives rode off into \nthe sunset, and Bayer was left holding the bag."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2417840,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why would Bayer buy Monsanto?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2420640,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If it's so obvious that they have hundreds of \nthousands of plaintiffs waiting for a verdict,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2426320,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "why would a company do something like that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2428320,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, I think that's the big question that \nthe investors are asking, or have asked."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2432560,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why in God's name did you do this?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2434800,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why did you do this?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2436480,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it was Wall Street \nJournal that had a headline,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2439600,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Worst Acquisition in History, \nor something like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2443280,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Bayer stock tanked immediately after the \nacquisition, and things only got worse for them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2448640,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A few months later, the first case against \nthe Monsanto-Bayer company went to trial."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2453200,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The plaintiff was Dewayne Lee Johnson,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2455440,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who had developed non-Hodgkin lymphoma after \naccidentally getting doused with Roundup at work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2460720,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The jury faced with evidence from the \nMonsanto Papers sided with Johnson,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2464720,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "awarding him $289 million in \ndamages, and Bayer had to pay up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2469840,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By 2025, Bayer had to settle \nmore than a hundred thousand  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2473200,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cancer lawsuits for the damages \ncaused by Monsanto's Roundup,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2476480,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "amounting to over $10 billion in settlements."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2480320,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Monsanto, which is now owned by \nGermany's Bayer, denies any wrongdoing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2485120,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they don't accept that Roundup could \nhave caused the plaintiffs' cancer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2488720,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So after all this publicity and scandal, \nhow dangerous is Roundup really?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2494320,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My question has always been,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2496160,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if it doesn't cause cancer and it's not dangerous \nand there's no real risk to human health,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2502160,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "why in God's name would Monsanto have to spend  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2505360,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "millions and millions and millions of \ndollars to create ghostwritten studies,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2510720,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and hire PR companies to \nghostwrite articles online?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2515920,
    "dDurationMs": 6240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And why would you have to engage in so much \ndeception if you truly had a safe product, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2522800,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, according to IARC, one of the biggest \nconcerns with glyphosate is genotoxicity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2527440,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some studies have shown that if \nyou get overexposed to glyphosate,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2530560,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like many farmers would,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2531840,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then the chemical might substantially \ndamage the DNA in your cells,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2535440,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is a common mechanism of \naction for many carcinogens."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2538960,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And other studies have actually \npointed to the shikimate pathway."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2542480,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Again, we don't use it, but \nthe bacteria in our gut do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2546320,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you ingest trace amounts of glyphosate,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2548640,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for example, through your food, it \ncould disrupt your gut's microbiome."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2553280,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you can disrupt the enzyme \nin the microflora in your gut,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2556960,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the EPSP enzyme, the synthase, it \ncould have all sorts of effects."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2561200,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, IARC never specified at what dose \nglyphosate actually becomes dangerous."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2566000,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just that overall glyphosate \nis a probable carcinogen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2570000,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And to put it into context, the other things \nin the same classification category are  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2574560,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "eating red meat or high temperature \nfrying or pulling a night shift."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2578720,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But these are lower than the number one \ncategory, which is a certain carcinogen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2582560,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And here of course you have \nalcohol and tobacco and sunlight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2585680,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And to give you context from our \nprevious episode on Forever Chemicals,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2589440,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "PFOA was a category one, so a certain carcinogen,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2594000,
    "dDurationMs": 8080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but PFOS is actually a category 2B, which is lower \nthan glyphosate at only a possible carcinogen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2602080,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From the data I've seen, glyphosate doesn't \nseem to be a particularly potent carcinogen,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2607600,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but high exposure to glyphosate \nis certainly associated with a  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2613360,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "modest increase in your ability \nto get certain types of cancers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2618000,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And people who have higher exposures \nare clearly at higher risk."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2622240,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2623040,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, the EPA and many other organizations \nlike the European Food Safety Authority still  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2628240,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "disagree with the IARC and claim that \nglyphosate isn't a likely carcinogen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2632800,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the courts in the United \nStates have repeatedly told  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2636400,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the EPA that they're not doing a proper analysis,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2639920,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they're not doing a proper assessment of \nglyphosate, they're not following their own rules."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2645040,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You said something like 50% of the \npapers that were about glyphosate  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2649440,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "safety and research and toxicity \nwere probably industry funded."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2654080,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, that's just a guess off the top of my head."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2656960,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Honestly, it could be much higher than 50%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2659760,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I certainly do not think it's lower than that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2662640,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's just always a desire by these \ncompanies to control the science."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2668000,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today, Bayer still denies that \nglyphosate is a carcinogen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2671680,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They would still tell you, they don't \nthink there's anything wrong with it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2674560,
    "dDurationMs": 640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2675200,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When my book came out, Bayer reached \nout to me, they sent me an email."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2678880,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it was really kind of quite strange."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2680960,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was like, \"Congratulations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2682240,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We've read your book and we've learned \na lot.\" I think Bayer feels different."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2688160,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And Bayer actually removed \nglyphosate from commercial products."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2692480,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this bottle of Roundup here doesn't \neven have glyphosate in it anymore."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2696560,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Part of the reason for that must be \nthe public backlash and the lawsuits,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2700080,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the other reason is that it \ndoesn't work that well anymore."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2703360,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We overused glyphosate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2705200,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, since the 1970s, more than 60 species \nof weed have become resistant to glyphosate,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2710720,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just like that first salmonella \nsample found near the factory."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2714400,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do they put in those Roundup \nsprays, if not glyphosate?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2718320,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, mostly full circle, so it's 2,4-D."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2724960,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Isn't that crazy?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2727680,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, you know, many people will probably go  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2730000,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through life not being affected \nin the slightest by glyphosate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2734160,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But others may develop cancer or other disease,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2736880,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's why it's really important to \nprotect the most sensitive individuals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2742000,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think another part of the problem here is how  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2744160,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a company as big as Monsanto \ncan just infiltrate academia."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2747760,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They have these big resources so they can just \npush around scientists and manipulate results."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2752800,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They create so much confusion, and \nthen they just avoid the punishment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2756560,
    "dDurationMs": 7440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you don't create firewalls between \nthe regulated and the regulators,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2764000,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you have created distrust in science."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2767680,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Inherently, science is \nalways going to be political."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2769920,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's never going to be disconnected \nfrom the realities of the world,  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2772880,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's always socially constructed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2774240,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But we can do a lot of things to put \nrules and regulations in place to try  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2779600,
    "dDurationMs": 10720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and make sure that there's a better sense of \nindependence and disconnection between this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2790320,
    "dDurationMs": 6240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I want to shout out two books, Carey Gillam's 'The \nMonsanto Papers' and Bart Elmore's 'Seed Money'."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2796560,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They were both incredibly valuable \nin researching this topic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2799760,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I also want to shout out people \nin the comments of our previous video  "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2802800,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on PFAS suggesting that we should cover Monsanto."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2806160,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
